                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e97991de-0676-49a1-994b-a763647c2250",
                                                "sense_id": "ae87d751-c4e5-30d5-9b1e-23067d24708c",
                                                "text": "Innocence and virgin Modestie […] / That would be woo’d, and not unsought be won"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4e369e1b-c439-444e-b7bb-caf785c4987c",
                                                "sense_id": "ae87d751-c4e5-30d5-9b1e-23067d24708c",
                                                "text": "He was now about twenty-three years old, and, though still virgin, the sex instinct that Miriam had over refined for so long now grew particularly strong."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9eb257f0-e176-4bd4-a01f-f8e474dca1a9",
                                                "sense_id": "ae87d751-c4e5-30d5-9b1e-23067d24708c",
                                                "text": "From their embraces was born the handsome Actaeon, a naive boy, who had less excuse than other men, given that he was her son, for believing her to be a virgin. It's true that he was even more virgin than his mother."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "02e49184-92e2-4da5-b956-fdcc4ed25142",
                                                "sense_id": "ae87d751-c4e5-30d5-9b1e-23067d24708c",
                                                "text": "Helvidius […] took the plain meaning of scripture to say that Jesus patently had brothers and sisters, so therefore his mother, Mary, had enjoyed a normal family life rather than remaining perpetually virgin."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e2f7d6ca-a3d0-33b6-b4c3-5c887d67806b",
                                        "entry_id": "d7871af3-4e2f-38cb-a063-b4023d734bc7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of a physical object, untouched."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3642a5fd-1d2e-4582-9ee9-268d6ef8a250",
                                                "sense_id": "e2f7d6ca-a3d0-33b6-b4c3-5c887d67806b",
                                                "text": "The white cold virgin snow upon my heart / Abates the ardour of my liver."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6f8c0396-12ba-469d-80ec-bd9f54742c75",
                                                "sense_id": "e2f7d6ca-a3d0-33b6-b4c3-5c887d67806b",
                                                "text": "There is something about virgin sand which arouses all the worst instincts of the detective-story writer. One feels an irresisitible impulse to go and make footprints all over it."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c34e7218-d4a1-310e-b77c-0122fee6efd4",
                                        "entry_id": "d7871af3-4e2f-38cb-a063-b4023d734bc7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Not yet cultivated, explored, or exploited by humans or humans of certain civilizations."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bde12f7f-e512-4a20-b695-71b7452c0a6c",
                                                "sense_id": "c34e7218-d4a1-310e-b77c-0122fee6efd4",
                                                "text": "The virgin lands of the Americas were awaiting the Europeans."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fa020fed-afe1-4ace-a1c5-c5155887f240",
                                                "sense_id": "c34e7218-d4a1-310e-b77c-0122fee6efd4",
                                                "text": "virgin prairie"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "117e0dc0-ed80-4b4a-b10e-0e64da20432f",
                                                "sense_id": "c34e7218-d4a1-310e-b77c-0122fee6efd4",
                                                "text": "virgin ecosystem"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5b6dc49a-f0ab-48c1-bdac-4d51f89224c6",
                                                "sense_id": "c34e7218-d4a1-310e-b77c-0122fee6efd4",
                                                "text": "virgin forest"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "35b41beb-b25c-4d34-aea0-4fd02fb082aa",
                                                "sense_id": "c34e7218-d4a1-310e-b77c-0122fee6efd4",
                                                "text": "virgin clay",
                                                "translation": "clay that has never been fired",
                                                "english": "clay that has never been fired"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e7d3d575-3e09-449e-b023-2cacbff15b9f",
                                                "sense_id": "c34e7218-d4a1-310e-b77c-0122fee6efd4",
                                                "text": "The same bounty of Summer, the same milde remission of Winter, with a more virgin and unexhausted soyle being materiall arguments to shew that modesty and truth receive no diminution by the comparison."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "78f394f4-9abe-491e-897c-1efe06c68937",
                                                "sense_id": "c34e7218-d4a1-310e-b77c-0122fee6efd4",
                                                "text": "For today’s owners of surveillance capital the experiential realities of bodies, thoughts and feelings are as virgin and blameless as nature’s once-plentiful meadows, rivers, oceans and forests before they fell to the market dynamic."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b8aebc63-f6ef-34de-b57d-b4a930dcae9a",
                                        "entry_id": "d7871af3-4e2f-38cb-a063-b4023d734bc7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Inexperienced."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "15102ebf-154c-4714-9d06-ec350454195f",
                                                "sense_id": "b8aebc63-f6ef-34de-b57d-b4a930dcae9a",
                                                "text": "The woman shook dangerously, an obvious virgin gunhandler."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "de4cfe65-7474-3075-9a67-489b524226eb",
                                        "entry_id": "d7871af3-4e2f-38cb-a063-b4023d734bc7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of olive oil, obtained by mechanical means, so that the oil is not altered."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d219f7cc-f016-413d-8d20-e8a8241a4f1a",
                                                "sense_id": "de4cfe65-7474-3075-9a67-489b524226eb",
                                                "text": "Wondering how some oil is somehow more virgin than regular virgin olive oil can be a real head-scratcher."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "92cd87ed-5e86-3c42-9963-1c0d263ec8c4",
                                        "entry_id": "d7871af3-4e2f-38cb-a063-b4023d734bc7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of mixed drinks, not containing alcohol."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "329bd35b-8fa1-4e8d-8fad-f325256db188",
                                                "sense_id": "92cd87ed-5e86-3c42-9963-1c0d263ec8c4",
                                                "text": "a virgin daiquiri"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
